From: Ubuntu Desktop bug work
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: sidebar: guard NULL row, slot, bookmark location, wallpaper error

Activation used the selected row (which can be NULL) instead of the
activated row. Alt+Down unmount had the same gap. Bookmark reorder
called nautilus_file_get_location() when the target file was gone.
Opening a place with no window_slot dereferenced NULL. Wallpaper
portal failure logged error->message when error was NULL.

Forwarded: no
